<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#15191f">
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="2">
    <title><%= title %> · Control Enrutador</title>
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { display: grid; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; place-items: center; padding: 24px; color: #202630; background: #15191f; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
      main { width: min(430px, 100%); padding: 34px; border-radius: 24px; background: white; box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgb(0 0 0 / 32%); }
      .label { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #b91c2b; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; }
      h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: clamp(30px, 8vw, 42px); line-height: 1.05; }
      p { margin: 0; color: #68717c; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.45; }
      .loader { width: 100%; height: 6px; margin-top: 26px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 99px; background: #eceff2; }
      .loader::after { display: block; width: 45%; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; background: #c61e2e; content: ''; animation: loading 1.1s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
      @keyframes loading { to { transform: translateX(122%); } }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p class="label">CONTROL ENRUTADOR</p>
      <h1>Conectando…</h1>
      <p>La aplicación estará lista en unos segundos. Esta pantalla se actualiza automáticamente.</p>
      <div class="loader" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
